000030517578},{"end":40.7400016784668,"text":"Stress on my shoulder like an anvil","start":38.41999816894531},{"end":44.380001068115234,"text":"Work it got me itching like I need help","start":41.5},{"end":47.599998474121094,"text":"Throat's killing me, I'm bleeding on help","start":44.540000915527344},{"end":51.619998931884766,"text":"Sometimes I just don't know how to fail","start":48.060001373291016},{"end":53.880001068115234,"text":"Phone call from depression","start":51.619998931884766},{"end":57,"text":"Use my past and my memories as a weapon","start":53.880001068115234},{"end":60.2400016784668,"text":"On the other line, talk talk to addiction","start":57.08000183105469},{"end":64.19999694824219,"text":"Speaking of the drugs, I miss them","start":60.779998779296875},{"end":66.68000030517578,"text":"This can't be real, is it fiction?","start":64.19999694824219},{"end":69.45999908447266,"text":"Something is broken again","start":67.5199966430664},{"end":73.45999908447266,"text":"I cry out for help, do they listen?","start":70.0199966430664},{"end":76.33999633789062,"text":"I'ma be alone until the finish","start":73.91999816894531},{"end":80.5999984741211,"text":"This is the part where I tell you I'm fine but I'm lying","start":76.66000366210938},{"end":83.12000274658203,"text":"I just don't want you to worry","start":80.5999984741211},{"end":87.16000366210938,"text":"This is the part where I take all my feelings and hide them","start":83.30000305175781},{"end":90.41999816894531,"text":"Cause I don't want nobody to hurt me, can't breathe","start":87.16000366210938},{"end":92.31999969482422,"text":"I'm waiting for the exhale","start":90.41999816894531},{"end":95.37999725341797,"text":"Touch my pain with my wishes and I wish them well","start":92.36000061035156},{"end":99.0199966430664,"text":"Still no life, but oh well","start":95.37999725341797},{"end":101.91999816894531,"text":"I still try even though I know I'm gon' fail","start":99.0199966430664},{"end":105.19